# Files kept in the repository but kept OUT of the codebase-memory knowledge graph.
#
# This is not .gitignore. Everything here is tracked, shipped and needed at runtime; it simply
# has no business being a queryable symbol. .gitignore is the wrong lever for that — these
# files must stay in the repo.
#
# Minified third-party bundles (#431). plugins/diviops-design-library/assets/js/three.min.js
# alone contributed 1,622 of the project's 7,970 graph nodes — 20.4% — from 603 KB on six
# lines of minified Three.js. Minifier output has mangled identifiers (`t`, `e`, single
# letters), so those nodes carry no meaning and compete in every BM25 and semantic ranking
# against the real symbols. It degraded every query in the repository, not just queries about
# the design library.
#
# Matched by pattern rather than by path so the next vendored bundle is excluded on arrival.
# Deliberately NOT the whole assets/js/ folder: design-fx.js beside it is ours and stays
# indexed.
**/*.min.js
